{"4564440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Envision Research Facility", "steam_appid": 4564440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You were sent to fix a simple fault.</strong><br><strong>No one said anything about losing contact with the entire team.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564440/extras/6f8d7236217dcf0935ff1a9b4d828209.avif?t=1775575917\" width=1560 height=660 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the 1980s, you play as a service technician dispatched to the <strong>Envision Research Facility</strong> after a reported system failure. Upon arrival, the facility stands silent — abandoned, yet not entirely empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore power, investigate the surroundings, and piece together what happened to the crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564440/extras/172ab489cab5d0682a9129f13842ba2f.avif?t=1775575917\" width=1560 height=660 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric <strong>walking simulator</strong> experience</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious research facility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with systems and equipment to restore functionality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the story through environment and discoveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal UI, focus on immersion</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You were sent to fix a simple fault.</strong><br><strong>No one said anything about losing contact with the entire team.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564440/extras/6f8d7236217dcf0935ff1a9b4d828209.avif?t=1775575917\" width=1560 height=660 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the 1980s, you play as a service technician dispatched to the <strong>Envision Research Facility</strong> after a reported system failure. Upon arrival, the facility stands silent — abandoned, yet not entirely empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore power, investigate the surroundings, and piece together what happened to the crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564440/extras/172ab489cab5d0682a9129f13842ba2f.avif?t=1775575917\" width=1560 height=660 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric <strong>walking simulator</strong> experience</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious research facility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with systems and equipment to restore functionality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the story through environment and discoveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal UI, focus on immersion</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A routine maintenance job turns into something far more unsettling. Investigate a remote research facility, restore power, and uncover what went wrong. Is anyone still alive? Or are you already too late?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.